41984239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/d6ee6201034d56c9709fe65601a288b7.mp4?t=1741984239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Combat can be brutal in Stoneguard, anyone and anything can lose limbs which will cause significant disadvantages in both battle and day to day life. But as long as the Lifestone is protected, there are ways to heal your battle wounds.<br>Accurate weapon tracing detects which body part has been hit. You must be tactful in combat to protect your vital limbs and choose which parts of your enemies to remove...<br><br>Strategise your defences before nightfall, then command and fight alongside your survivors in combat, whilst giving out orders during the thick of battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/84a6c489aefae4ca39ea789e9b2448a8.webp?t=1741984239\" width=616 height=40 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique and immersive RTS</strong></h2><br>Experience a strategy game from a third person point of view, with a dynamic day and night cycle which ties in the three phases of gameplay; day time, preparation phase and night time.<br><br>During the day, you will be able to gather and manage your resources, craft items, and construct fortifications and buildings for various uses.<br><br>At dusk, the preparation phase begins. The time of day is now paused and all resource gathering and construction ceases. This phase enables you to strategize in your own time; manage survivors into groups, which you can order into defensive positions, formations, and combat behaviour. You can also swap your own equipment and that of the survivors.<br>When ready, you can end the preparation phase and the night time battle commences.<br><br>Once the night starts, waves of monsters will attack you and your settlement until dawn arrives.<br><br><span 